    {
      "text": "Access to Zscaler 3rd-Party App Governance logs requires Advanced SaaS Security Posture Management (SSPM). To get Advanced SSPM, contact your Zscaler Account team."
    },
    {
      "text": "The 3rd-Party App Governance Nanolog Streaming Service (NSS) feed specifies the data from the 3rd-Party App Governance logs that the NSS sends to your security information and event management system, or SIEM. You can configure an NSS feed by including one or more fields. The fields and their values display in the NSS feed output."
    },
